<section id="b2b-platform" data-aud-show="b2b" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section_header is-tight"><h2 class="heading-h2">Everything B2B, in one platform</h2><p class="text-lead">Your pricing logic, your ERP, your customers&#x27; way of ordering - B2Bware covers it end to end. Start with what you need and add more later.</p></div><div class="wc-grid"><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"/><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M10 6h4"/><path d="M10 10h4"/><path d="M10 14h4"/><path d="M10 18h4"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">B2B customer portal</h3><p class="card_text">Customer prices, tiered prices, price rules and contract terms 1:1. Each customer sees only their assortment - with approvals, budgets and digital quotes.</p><a href="/distributors" class="route-link">Customer portals →</a></div><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><path d="m17 2 4 4-4 4"/><path d="M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14"/><path d="m7 22-4-4 4-4"/><path d="M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">24/7 self-service</h3><p class="card_text">Reorder from history, favorites or by item number. Track orders and shipments, download invoices and delivery notes - multiple companies in one account.</p><a href="/wholesalers" class="route-link">For wholesalers →</a></div><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">Sales App for field reps</h3><p class="card_text">Live prices, stock and customer history, even offline. The order is captured at the customer and goes straight to the ERP.</p><a href="/modules/sales-app" class="route-link">Sales App →</a></div><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"/><path d="M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">OrderHub · AI order intake</h3><p class="card_text">PDF, email, Excel, EDI or WhatsApp: AI reads the order, checks it against your master data and hands a clean order to your ERP.</p><a href="/modules/order-hub" class="route-link">OrderHub →</a></div><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><path d="M12 22v-5"/><path d="M9 8V2"/><path d="M15 8V2"/><path d="M18 8v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8Z"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">ERP at the core</h3><p class="card_text">Prices, stock and orders sync automatically - no retyping, no reconciling. 400+ systems natively connected, and without an ERP B2Bware runs on its own.</p><a href="https://syncspider.com/integrations/" class="route-link">400+ integrations →</a></div><div class="wc-card"><div class="wc-icon"><div class="w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div></div><h3 class="heading-h3">B2B search and AI</h3><p class="card_text">Typo-tolerant search that knows your, manufacturer and customer item numbers. Customers can even order from ChatGPT or Claude via MCP - AI hosted in Germany.</p></div></div></div></section>